{"file": "天灾末世，她囤满物资后所向披靡！-第244集.mp4", "ep": 244, "duration": 47.0, "segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 0.5, "text": "停"}, {"start": 0.8, "end": 1.6, "text": "也不用所有人"}, {"start": 1.6, "end": 2.2, "text": "就你死"}, {"start": 2.92, "end": 3.36, "text": "怎么"}, {"start": 3.52, "end": 4.16, "text": "不敢发了"}, {"start": 4.56, "end": 5.32, "text": "不敢就承认"}, {"start": 5.52, "end": 6.12, "text": "现在认"}, {"start": 6.12, "end": 6.84, "text": "陆队长最多"}, {"start": 6.84, "end": 7.92, "text": "扣你们一半物资"}, {"start": 8.12, "end": 9.0, "text": "好 我发誓"}, {"start": 9.24, "end": 10.2, "text": "他要是空间异能者"}, {"start": 10.4, "end": 10.96, "text": "我死"}, {"start": 13.76, "end": 14.48, "text": "你要干什么"}, {"start": 15.04, "end": 16.2, "text": "空间异能者"}, {"start": 16.44, "end": 17.64, "text": "死了会爆物资"}, {"start": 18.42, "end": 19.14, "text": "我厌厌"}, {"start": 19.42, "end": 20.46, "text": "就知真假"}, {"start": 21.22, "end": 22.02, "text": "你不能这样"}, {"start": 22.38, "end": 23.34, "text": "你这是杀人"}, {"start": 23.5, "end": 24.1, "text": "韩清夏"}, {"start": 24.54, "end": 25.22, "text": "你凭两句话"}, {"start": 25.22, "end": 25.94, "text": "就杀人来厌"}, {"start": 26.54, "end": 27.54, "text": "他要不是空间异能者"}, {"start": 27.54, "end": 27.98, "text": "我死"}, {"start": 28.57, "end": 29.09, "text": "凭我"}, {"start": 29.33, "end": 30.29, "text": "跟你们堵命死"}, {"start": 30.65, "end": 31.73, "text": "我不是空间异能者"}, {"start": 31.73, "end": 32.29, "text": "别杀我"}, {"start": 32.49, "end": 33.45, "text": "都给我发出来"}, {"start": 34.26, "end": 35.22, "text": "前脚刚发的誓"}, {"start": 35.62, "end": 36.82, "text": "后脚自己人就打脸"}, {"start": 37.02, "end": 37.54, "text": "陆队长"}, {"start": 37.7, "end": 38.22, "text": "我知不知道"}, {"start": 38.22, "end": 39.34, "text": "他是空间异能者呀"}, {"start": 39.82, "end": 40.5, "text": "你个骗子"}, {"start": 40.7, "end": 41.3, "text": "瞒着我"}, {"start": 41.3, "end": 42.38, "text": "还害我发那种誓"}, {"start": 42.54, "end": 43.22, "text": "既然认了"}, {"start": 43.46, "end": 44.34, "text": "东西也拿出来了"}, {"start": 44.58, "end": 45.62, "text": "你们这次物资砍办"}, {